 m = np.mean(vals)\n        print(f'  {k:<16}: {m:8.2f} ({m/tot*100:5.1f}%)')\n\"","dir_path":"/workspace","description":"Decompose CRPS across scoring intervals for CRYPTO_24H, COM_EQU_24H, and CRYPTO_1H."}}
