{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:57:37.958Z","tool_name":"update_topic","tool_id":"update_topic__call_199162","parameters":{"summary":"Iteration 1 improved CRPS across all three competitions on both Window A and Window B (6/6 competition-window totals and 30/36 asset-window cells). Error analysis of Iteration 1 showed two specific issues: (1) using the uncalibrated L2 RMS scale (c=1.0) over-predicts fan width by 12-25% relative to the CRPS-optimal scale under leptokurtic returns, and (2) assigning multi-minute gap variance entirely to the ending half-hour slot distorted seasonality on XAU and thin equities. In Iteration 2, I will fix the seasonality gap distribution, combine robust L1 (MAD) and Winsorized L2 deseasonalized volatility estimators with pre-2026-09-08 CRPS scale calibration, and optimize simulate() speed by 10x.","title":"Iteration 2: CRPS Scale Calibration & Robust L1-L2 Hybrid Volatility","strategic_intent":"Investigate and implement Iteration 2: CRPS-optimal scale calibration, robust L1-L2 hybrid deseasonalized volatility, fixed multi-minute gap seasonality, and fast vectorized execution."}}
{"type":"tool_result","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:57:38.422Z","tool_id":"update_topic__call_199162","status":"success","output":"## 📂 Topic: **Iteration 2: CRPS Scale Calibration & Robust L1-L2 Hybrid Volatility**\n\n**Summary:**\nIteration 1 improved CRPS across all three competitions on both Window A and Window B (6/6 competition-window totals and 30/36 asset-window cells). Error analysis of Iteration 1 showed two specific issues: (1) using the uncalibrated L2 RMS scale (c=1.0) over-predicts fan width by 12-25% relative to the CRPS-optimal scale under leptokurtic returns, and (2) assigning multi-minute gap variance entirely to the ending half-hour slot distorted seasonality on XAU and thin equities. In Iteration 2, I will fix the seasonality gap distribution, combine robust L1 (MAD) and Winsorized L2 deseasonalized volatility estimators with pre-2026-09-08 CRPS scale calibration, and optimize simulate() speed by 10x.\n\n> [!STRATEGY]\n> **Intent:** Investigate and implement Iteration 2: CRPS-optimal scale calibration, robust L1-L2 hybrid deseasonalized volatility, fixed multi-minute gap seasonality, and fast vectorized execution."}
