file[15:20], 2)} | min29-34={np.round(m_profile[29:34], 2)} | min55-59={np.round(m_profile[55:], 2)}')\n\"","description":"Measure 5-minute intraday profile around US Open and minute-of-hour profile on crypto on 2026-05-18 to 2026-09-07."}}
