{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":"2026-10-22T02:31:45.536Z","tool_name":"replace","tool_id":"replace__call_236321","parameters":{"instruction":"Append Iteration 7 scale ablation and final campaign summary table to agent/journal.md.","old_string":"- **Verdict**: Keep (10/10 `CRYPTO_1H` cells and both `COM_EQU_24H` window totals improved).\n- **Lesson**: Binning `dropna()` returns into 5-minute blocks (`_compute_5m_mad_ewma`) and anchoring Parkinson OHLC range at the 7-day scale (`_compute_ohlc_log_ewma`) cleanly improves all 10 `CRYPTO_1H` cells and `COM_EQU_24H` across both regimes.","file_path":"/workspace/agent/journal.md","new_string":"- **Verdict**: Keep (10/10 `CRYPTO_1H` cells and both `COM_EQU_24H` window totals improved).\n- **Lesson**: Binning `dropna()` returns into 5-minute blocks (`_compute_5m_mad_ewma`) and anchoring Parkinson OHLC range at the 7-day scale (`_compute_ohlc_log_ewma`) cleanly improves all 10 `CRYPTO_1H` cells and `COM_EQU_24H` across both regimes.\n\n---\n\n## Iteration 7 — `CRYPTO_24H` Scale Sensitivity Check (`c_scale = 0.935` vs `0.96`)\n- **Hypothesis**: On the pre-validation period (`2026-07-15` to `2026-09-05`), sweeping `c_scale` suggested `0.935` might slightly improve `CRYPTO_24H` by compensating for the `1.026x` average weekday scale of `FORWARD_S_336`.\n- **Change**: Tested `PARAMS_CRYPTO_24H = (0.935, 0.28, 0.22)` vs `(0.96, 0.28, 0.22)` across Window A and Window B.\n- **Result**:\n  - Window B (`2026-10-01` → `2026-10-11`): `CRYPTO_24H` mean CRPS improved `3361.176 → 3358.527` (-2.65).\n  - Window A (`2026-09-15` → `2026-09-25`): `CRYPTO_24H` mean CRPS regressed `4806.300 → 4809.346` (+3.05).\n- **Verdict**: Revert (`git checkout -- agent/modeling.py` back to Iteration 6).\n- **Lesson**: Lowering `c_scale` from `0.96` to `0.935` trades off high-volatility regime performance (Window A) against calm regime performance (Window B), violating our cross-regime consistency rule. Iteration 6 remains the champion.\n\n---\n\n## Final Campaign Summary (Iteration 0 Baseline → Iteration 6 Champion, 1000 Simulations)\n\n| Competition | Window | Iter 0 (Starter) Mean CRPS | Iter 6 (Champion) Mean CRPS | CRPS Change | Iter 0 Coef CRPS | Iter 6 Coef CRPS | Iter 0 Mean Gap | Iter 6 Mean Gap |\n| :--- | :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| **Crypto 24h** | **Win A** (`09-15..09-25`) | 4906.568 | **4806.300** | **-100.268** | 4597.614 | **4504.623** | +3.70% | **+1.21%** |\n| **Crypto 24h** | **Win B** (`10-01..10-11`) | 3528.842 | **3361.176** | **-167.666** | 3326.500 | **3162.712** | +10.56% | **+2.14%** |\n| **Com/Equ 24h** | **Win A** (`09-15..09-25`) | 2161.553 | **1893.225** | **-268.328** | 1780.843 | **1563.969** | +30.32% | **+2.17%** |\n| **Com/Equ 24h** | **Win B** (`10-01..10-11`) | 2062.542 | **1763.650** | **-298.892** | 1686.077 | **1438.132** | +47.25% | **+3.86%** |\n| **Crypto 1h** | **Win A** (`09-15..09-25`) | 1060.074 | **1024.679** | **-35.395** | 992.517 | **959.909** | +10.88% | **+5.12%** |\n| **Crypto 1h** | **Win B** (`10-01..10-11`) | 740.814 | **687.217** | **-53.597** | 699.090 | **646.685** | +23.44% | **+5.18%** |\n"}}
